{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>theBOLL</strong> is an arcade platformer with realistic physics, tight mechanics, and a bit of personality. It\u2019s just you, the level, and one goal \u2014 roll to the end. Or slow down and explore every corner in search of hidden secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>YOUR BALL, MYOUR RULES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re just a ball \u2014 and that\u2019s the point. No distractions. Just you, gravity, and the path you choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/690x256-6.gif?t=1747403750\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>REALISTIC PHYSICS, SIMPLE CONTROLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump, roll, slide \u2014 everything feels natural. The challenge isn\u2019t in the buttons, but in the levels. Easy to pick up, hard to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/690x256-1.gif?t=1747403750\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A CHILL WAY TO PLAY \u2014 WITH SECRETS TO FIND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not into racing the clock? That\u2019s fine. Take your time, explore, and look for hidden stuff. There are plenty of secrets \u2014 some of them quite unexpected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/690x256-3.gif?t=1747403750\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LEVELS BUILT FOR SPEEDRUNS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No scripts. No randomness. Just you and precision. Every level can be beaten faster \u2014 sometimes <i>a lot</i> faster \u2014 if you find the right line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/690x256-2.gif?t=1747403750\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GLOBAL LEADERBOARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to know how good you really are? The rankings will show you. Or remind you there\u2019s always someone quicker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/690x256-5.gif?t=1747403750\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>theBOLL. Just roll. Or explore. It\u2019s all fair.</strong> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3377300?t=1747403750","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747403750","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/eab2da60f5cbcd83a5b1c0435c7a7b61d980e55d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747403750","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/eab2da60f5cbcd83a5b1c0435c7a7b61d980e55d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747403750","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>theBOLL</strong> is an arcade platformer with realistic physics, tight mechanics, and a bit of personality. It\u2019s just you, the level, and one goal \u2014 roll to the end. Or slow down and explore every corner in search of hidden secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>YOUR BALL, MYOUR RULES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re just a ball \u2014 and that\u2019s the point. No distractions. Just you, gravity, and the path you choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/690x256-6.gif?t=1747403750\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>REALISTIC PHYSICS, SIMPLE CONTROLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump, roll, slide \u2014 everything feels natural. The challenge isn\u2019t in the buttons, but in the levels. Easy to pick up, hard to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/690x256-1.gif?t=1747403750\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A CHILL WAY TO PLAY \u2014 WITH SECRETS TO FIND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not into racing the clock? That\u2019s fine. Take your time, explore, and look for hidden stuff. There are plenty of secrets \u2014 some of them quite unexpected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/690x256-3.gif?t=1747403750\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LEVELS BUILT FOR SPEEDRUNS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No scripts. No randomness. Just you and precision. Every level can be beaten faster \u2014 sometimes <i>a lot</i> faster \u2014 if you find the right line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/690x256-2.gif?t=1747403750\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GLOBAL LEADERBOARDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to know how good you really are? The rankings will show you. Or remind you there\u2019s always someone quicker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/extras/690x256-5.gif?t=1747403750\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>theBOLL. Just roll. Or explore. It\u2019s all fair.</strong> </p>","developers":["Rogue Thunder"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377300/header.jpg?t=1747403750","is_free":true,"linux